TI  - A comprehensive analysis of perturbation methods in explainable AI feature attribution validation for neural time series classifiers
T2  - SCIENTIFIC REPORTS
LA  - English
KW  - Explainable AI
KW  - Deep learning
KW  - Attribution methods
KW  - Evaluation
KW  - Time series
KW  - DDS
