TI  - From Black-Box to Glass-Box: Explainable Plant Disease Segmentation for Early Detection Using SegFormer
T2  - PERVASIVE DIGITAL SERVICES FOR PEOPLE'S WELL-BEING, INCLUSION AND SUSTAINABLE DEVELOPMENT, I3E 2025
LA  - English
