TI  - Toward Practical Usage of the Attention Mechanism as a Tool for Interpretability
T2  - IEEE ACCESS
LA  - English
KW  - Natural language processing
KW  - explainable AI
KW  - interpretability
KW  - LSTM
KW  - GRU
KW  - recurrent neural network
KW  - REGRESSION
