TI  - DBGT-PLA: Dual-Branch Graph-Transformer Fusion for Interpretable Protein- Ligand Affinity Prediction
T2  - IEEE JOURNAL OF BIOMEDICAL AND HEALTH INFORMATICS
LA  - English
KW  - Protein-Ligand affinity
KW  - XAI method
KW  - graph neural network
KW  - graph transformer
