TI  - Hybrid feature fusion in cervical cancer cytology: a novel dual-module approach framework for lesion detection and classification using radiomics, deep learning, and reproducibility
T2  - FRONTIERS IN ONCOLOGY
LA  - English
KW  - cervical cytology
KW  - deep learning
