TI  - Multimodal fusion of ECG and chest X-ray with deep learning and radiomics for cardiac diagnosis: A machine learning-based nomogram approach
T2  - JOURNAL OF RADIATION RESEARCH AND APPLIED SCIENCES
LA  - English
KW  - Radiomic features
KW  - Deep learning
